2:T726,<h1>The UK's Most Versatile <span class="ident">Character Voiceover</span> Artist</h1>
<p>Across TV, radio, games, apps and animation, my character voices pop up everywhere. From heroic narrators to unhinged goblins, 
and from blockbuster game villains to silly cartoon sidekicks — I lend my voice to worlds big and small, including my popular <a href="/david-attenborough-voice" title="David Attenborough Voice" class="isred">David Attenborough impression</a>. 
If you’ve got a script bursting with personality, I can bring it to life.</p>

<!-- Mini Player Character Voice -->
<div style="margin:20px 0;">
  <audio controls style="width:100%; max-width:420px;">
    <source src="/assets/audio/guy-harris-voiceoverguy-character-showreel.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
    Your browser does not support the audio element.
  </audio>
  <p style="font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;">
    Character Voice Showreel – Guy Harris
  </p>
</div>

<p>I've created iconic character voices for <a href="/boom-beach-hammerman-voice" title="Boom Beach Hammerman Voiceover">Boom Beach</a>, 
<a href="/minecraft-combat-voiceover" title="Minecraft Character Voice">Minecraft</a>, 
<a href="/clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover" title="Clash of Clans Goblin Voice">Clash of Clans</a>, 
<a href="/thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty" title="Salty Thomas & Friends">Thomas & Friends</a>, 
<a href="/joker-voice" title="Joker Voiceover">The Joker</a>, 
and even <a href="/playmobil-pirate-voice" title="Pirate Voiceover">singing pirates</a>.  
If it’s From swashbuckling <a href="/pirate-voice" title="Pirate Voice" class="isred">pirate voices</a> to the big man himself in my <a href="/santa-voice" title="Santa Voice" class="isred">Santa voice</a>, if it’s wild, wacky or wonderfully weird — I’m your guy.</p>3:T497,<h2><span class="ident">Crazy Voice Guy</span> | Unique Voices for Unique Characters</h2>
<p>Hi there — I’m the Crazy Voice Guy. Whether you need a gangsta raccoon, a hopelessly romantic robot, a grumpy wizard,
a lovable dog, or a full-on cartoon lunatic, I’m always up for creating something new. Character work is where I get to play,
experiment and throw everything at the wall until the perfect voice appears.</p>

<p>Want to hear some more? This showreel features <a href="/game-trailer-voice" title="Game Trailer Voice" class="isred">gaming voices</a>, silly accents, singing characters and some truly daft creations.
If you need a voice with personality (or several personalities), let’s chat.</p>

<p>For more examples, check out:
<br>&bull; <a href="/super-hero-voice" title="Super Hero Voice">Super Hero Voice</a>
<br>&bull; <a href="/seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover" title="Crazy Seabrooks Penny Voice">Seabrooks “In For a Penny”</a>
<br>&bull; <a href="/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice" title="Ghost Face Voice">Ghost Face Voice</a>
<br>&bull; <a href="/pantomime-dame-voice" title="Panto Dame Voice">Pantomime Dame Voice</a>
</p>5:T6c2,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover#faq","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What character voices has Guy Harris performed?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Guy Harris has voiced over 100 characters for games, apps, animation, radio and online media including Boom Beach, Minecraft, Clash of Clans, Thomas & Friends, Joker-style voices and more."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I book Guy Harris for a character voiceover?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Guy Harris is available for bespoke character voiceovers via Zoom, Cleanfeed or Teams, and can work with reference clips or custom direction."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Where can I find a character voiceover?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Guy Harris is one of the UK's most in-demand character voiceover artists. With over 25 years' experience in radio, TV, films and social media content, his voice has been heard in more places than you can imagine."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is the voice of the trains in Thomas the Tank Engine?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Guy Harris is the voice of Winston, Salty and Troublesome Tanker 2 in Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go, and also voices other characters such as Mr Messy and Mr Funny in the Mr Men series."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who is a great voice for Santa or Father Christmas?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Guy Harris is widely considered the Voice of Santa thanks to his work for BBC Radio 1, BBC Radio 2, the Heart Network, Asda, Tesco, ITV, Butlins, Capital Radio and more, delivering a traditional, jovial British Father Christmas performance."}}]}0:["E629L-picyU8U0_43u8z4",[[["",{"children":["character-voiceover",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["character-voiceover",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1>A page of <span class=\"ident\"> Character voiceover</span> showreels</h1>\r\n<p>My character voiceovers are heard on TV, Radio, Apps, Games & Virals worldwide daily. <br>\r\n“I hear voices in my head” that's me on a daily basis. So if you have a script and project, let me unleash them! </p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[[["$","div","0",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ad85PPvSfbc","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$3"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/k7DZFWnOcvo","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Let’s <span class=\"ident\">Work Together</span></h2>\r\n<p>Got a script ready? Or maybe you’ve just got a rough idea and need help shaping it? No problem. I can direct your session live via \r\nCleanfeed, Zoom or Teams, helping you fine-tune pacing, personality and performance.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Whether it’s a <a href=\"/masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins\" title=\"Voice of God\">big booming announcer</a>, \r\na <a href=\"/pathe-news-jack-fm\" title=\"Pathe Voice\">retro Pathe News narrator</a>, \r\na <a href=\"/craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover\" title=\"Craig Cash Voice\">Craig Cash-style Gogglebox character</a>,\r\nor a <a href=\"/star-wars-character-voices\" title=\"Star Wars Voice\">Star Wars creature voice</a>,\r\nI’m ready to help bring your character to life.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you’ve got a YouTube clip or reference voice you want me to start from, even better. \r\nReady to turn your character into something unforgettable? \r\n<a href=\"/contact-guy\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Contact Guy Harris\">Get in touch</a> today.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/character-voiceover.jpg","alt":"Character Voiceover – Guy Harris","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}]]}]],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Character Voiceover – Voice Creation","pageUrl":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover"}]]}]}],[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover#webpage\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover\",\"name\":\"Character Voiceover – Voice Creation by Guy Harris\",\"description\":\"Character voiceovers by Guy Harris. From gaming villains to cartoon heroes, discover unique voices for apps, games, animation and comedy. Listen to the showreels.\"}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","d